

/*
1. Use Customers Data - RAW Schema
 
2. Load data into customer table (via a task using external stage) and build CDC pipeline to populate NSW / New South Wales to NSW Table and Queensland data to Queensland table

Use Streams, Tasks, Merge -Curated Schema
 
3. From NSW table and Queensland, create atleast 2 dynamic table each to populate based on cities -DT Schema
 
4. Row Access policy on Curated tables based on City. Need roles and users according to the cities available for these states. Do RBAC for the new roles.
 	
*/



